WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.854
Dad was in the driveway.

2
00:00:05.855 --> 00:00:10.303
He was setting up a basketball hoop.

3
00:00:10.304 --> 00:00:17.363
"That looks like fun!" Mom said.

4
00:00:17.364 --> 00:00:21.066
Harry tossed the basketball at the hoop.

5
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.467
He missed, and the ball rolled away.

6
00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:33.791
Oliver and Rover got the ball.

7
00:00:33.792 --> 00:00:36.500
Harry tried again and missed.

8
00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:42.039
"This is too hard!" he said.

9
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:50.935
"Let me have a turn," Emmy said.

10
00:00:50.936 --> 00:00:54.693
But she couldn't score either.

11
00:00:54.694 --> 00:01:00.015
"This is too hard!" she said.

12
00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:03.829
"I'll show you," Dad said.

13
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.127
He bounced the ball off the backboard.

14
00:01:06.128 --> 00:01:09.944
It went right into the basket.

15
00:01:09.945 --> 00:01:15.642
"You just need to practice," he said.

16
00:01:15.643 --> 00:01:19.607
Dad made a slam dunk.

17
00:01:19.608 --> 00:01:22.854
"Let's play a game," Mom said to him.

18
00:01:22.855 --> 00:01:32.827
"The first one to make five shots wins."

19
00:01:32.828 --> 00:01:45.721
Mom won the first game.

20
00:01:45.722 --> 00:01:48.514
Mom won the next game too.

21
00:01:48.515 --> 00:01:54.015
Dad sighed.

22
00:01:54.016 --> 00:01:57.636
"We want to try again!" Harry said.

23
00:01:57.637 --> 00:02:01.944
"Give us another turn!" Emmy said.

24
00:02:01.945 --> 00:02:05.266
Harry and Emmy took turns throwing.

25
00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:10.969
They kept missing the basket.

26
00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:17.232
"The hoop is too high," Oliver said.

27
00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:20.574
Dad moved the hoop down.

28
00:02:20.575 --> 00:02:31.240
"That's better!" Emmy said.

29
00:02:31.241 --> 00:02:40.890
Harry and Emmy played for a while.

30
00:02:40.891 --> 00:02:48.388
"Give us a chance again!" Mom said.

31
00:02:48.389 --> 00:02:51.479
Swish! Swish! Swish!

32
00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.401
The ball kept dropping into the basket.

33
00:02:54.402 --> 00:03:02.691
Dad shrugged. "Now it's too easy!"

